---
import {sitePath} from '../lib/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
const faqs=[['Is this a real guesthouse?','DAR SERA is a fictional guesthouse website created as a design and development project. The house, services, prices and policies are illustrative.'],['Can I book or pay here?','You can explore a complete demo stay-planning flow. It does not reserve a room, check real availability, collect payment or send an email.'],['What is included in the demo rate?','The concept rate includes the room, breakfast, Wi-Fi, air conditioning, linen and towels. No actual services are provided.'],['How many guests can stay in a room?','Each room accommodates up to 2 adults. This demonstration models adult stays only and does not include extra beds.'],['Are there stairs?','The Light Room, Terrace Suite and shared rooftop are reached by stairs. There is no lift. Ground-floor rooms are not certified as step-free or accessible.'],['Can I arrange an airport transfer?','A transfer can be noted as an inquiry in your demo stay plan. No transport is arranged and no transfer is included in the illustrative rate.'],['What are the cancellation terms?','There is no real reservation or cancellation contract. The demonstration does not create a booking or financial obligation.']];
---
<Layout title="Your Stay">
 <section class="page-opening wrap"><p class="eyebrow">THE SIMPLE PLEASURES</p><h1>A little less planned.<br/><em>A little more present.</em></h1><p class="opening-description">Breakfast at the shared table. A cool room after a walk. The everyday details of an imagined stay, considered with care.</p></section>
 <section class="wrap stay-photos"><figure><Photo id={4} eager/><figcaption>A table for a slow beginning.</figcaption></figure><figure><Photo id={23}/><figcaption>Bread, fruit and handmade ceramics.</figcaption></figure></section>
 <section class="wrap section stay-details"><div><p class="eyebrow">INCLUDED IN YOUR DEMO STAY</p><h2>Comfort, without<br/><em>the complication.</em></h2><p>Every room has a private shower room, air conditioning, Wi-Fi, linen and towels. Breakfast is included in the illustrative nightly rate.</p><p>The lounge, courtyard and rooftop are shared. Choose a private room, and enjoy the rest of the house at your own pace.</p><Photo id={24} sizes="(max-width: 700px) 90vw, 35vw"/></div><div class="practical"><p class="eyebrow">GOOD TO KNOW · DEMO POLICIES</p><dl><div><dt>Arrival</dt><dd>Check-in from 15:00</dd></div><div><dt>Departure</dt><dd>Check-out by 11:00</dd></div><div><dt>Guests</dt><dd>Up to 2 adults per room</dd></div><div><dt>Breakfast</dt><dd>Included in the demo rate</dd></div><div><dt>Smoking</dt><dd>Not permitted indoors</dd></div><div><dt>Getting upstairs</dt><dd>Stairs only · no lift</dd></div><div><dt>Transfers</dt><dd>Inquiry only · not included</dd></div></dl><p class="fine-print">All policies describe a fictional property. No accommodation or transport service is offered.</p><a class="button" href={sitePath('/plan-your-stay/')}>Try a stay plan <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
 <section class="wrap section faq-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW ANSWERS</p><h2>Before<br/><em>you arrive.</em></h2></div><div class="faqs">{faqs.map(([q,a])=><details><summary>{q}<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{a}</p></details>)}</div></section>
</Layout>
